  <item>
    <title>散步访谈02·蛙蛙狗：我有着对不朽的渴望</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6873cc6293fd2d72b8fa30f8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6873cc6293fd2d72b8fa30f8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Jul 2025 15:24:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期为系列访谈的第2期，主题为：从职业出发，聊聊30代的人还能选择什么人生路径。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：卓老师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：蛙蛙狗。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a> 在前司没法实现我的职业愿景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 想做的还是我觉得好看的书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 提“网上散步”这个播客名称，可以在小红书“上海文艺出版社”的店铺中购买《对工作说不》时</span><strong><span>力减5元</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 为读者做书很辛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 中国有把书看得太重的传统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">21:42</a> 对同事间的关系没有要求是打工人对自我的异化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">25:54</a> 这是我想要的人生吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1999">33:19</a> 我有对不朽的渴望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2281">38:01</a> 我已经没有什么榜样了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 我现在就去投一个短剧写手也能投上吧</span></p>]]></description>
